{"ref":"BDB, אָבָק","hw":"אָבָק","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָבָק</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.10\">Ez 26:10</a></sup> <strong>dust</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:24\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.24\">Dt 28:24</a> + 3 textual; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבַק</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:3\" href=\"/Nahum.1.3\">Na 1:3</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבָקָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.10\">Ez 26:10</a>—<em>dust</em> <strong>(</strong>?fleeing, flying; syn. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָפָר</span> = oft. dust lying on or composing ground<strong>)</strong> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:9\" href=\"/Exodus.9.9\">Ex 9:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.10\">Ez 26:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:24\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.24\">Dt 28:24</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עָפָר</span>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.24\">Is 5:24</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מָק</span>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.5\">29:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹץ</span>); fig. of clouds under Yahweh’s feet <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:3\" href=\"/Nahum.1.3\">Na 1:3</a>.","next":"BDB, אֲבָקָה","prev":"BDB, אבק"}